    "label": "SITL 19 TCP connection template",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "TCP client connection to 127.0.0.1:5760 (ArduPilot SERIAL0). Bring up the opt-in lab: cd sitl && docker compose --profile tcp up -d --build (nrc-ap-tcp-1). PX4 TCP (socat bridge) is on :5770 — not this flow. Harness skips when :5760 is closed.",
