  {
    "id": "sitl25-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl25-tab",
    "name": "TCP template - requires exposed SITL TCP",
    "info": "Connection mode=tcp, remoteHost 127.0.0.1, remotePort 5760.\n\nOpt-in Compose profile (not the UDP sitl fleet):\n  cd sitl && docker compose --profile tcp up -d --build\n\nThat starts nrc-ap-tcp-1 (SITL SERIAL0 TCP server on host :5760) and nrc-px4-tcp-11 + socat sidecar (PX4 GCS UDP bridged to host TCP :5770). This flow dials the AP port only.\n\nReceive path: HEARTBEAT. Inject: one NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT when the TCP peer is up. Suite skips when :5760 is not listening.",
    "x": 300,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
